  "details": "Opening the big menu when dead in a world with the old combat system enabled makes you permanently immobile.\n\n1. Join a world with the combat system enabled.\n\n2. Get killed in the combat system.\n\n3. While being dead in a rag doll state, open the main menu and keep it open until you respawn.\n\n4. After you've respawned you're stuck in place until you rejoin the instance.\n\nTrying to respawn, die again or using Networking.LocalPlayer.Immobilize(); to resolve the problem does nothing.\n\nVideo showing problem: https://youtu.be/Gj0rYVbSEvU\n\nGreat world to test this is. Walk out into the road and get hit by a car.\n\nWorld for test: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_6b77c061-a1bf-48eb-b107-c4d944490198",
